---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "../../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../../components/Footer.astro";
import ScrollReveal from "../../components/ScrollReveal.tsx";
import { SITE } from "../../config/site.mjs";

const wifiNetworks = ["Blue", "Purple", "Green", "Yellow"];
---

<Layout
  title={`Welcome | ${SITE.title}`}
  description="A guide for confirmed Giveth House guests."
  canonicalURL={`${SITE.url}/guests/welcome-k7m4q2`}
  noindex={true}
  nofollow={true}
>
  <Header />
  <main id="main-content" role="main">
    <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-10 md:py-20">

      <ScrollReveal client:idle>
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-ink mb-4">Welcome to Giveth House!</h1>
      </ScrollReveal>

      <ScrollReveal client:load delay={0.1}>
        <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-ink-muted mb-10 md:mb-12">
          Here's everything you need for your stay. Franco will send you the exact address by
          message.
        </p>
      </ScrollReveal>

      <ScrollReveal client:load delay={0.15}>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink mb-4">Getting here</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-ink-muted mb-10 md:mb-12">
          <li>
            The house is in Sants, about a 10-minute walk from Barcelona-Sants train station.
          </li>
          <li>
            From the airport (BCN), three options:
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 mt-2 space-y-2">
              <li>
                <strong class="text-ink">Train:</strong>
                Rodalies R2 Nord from Terminal 2 to Sants Estació (about 20 minutes), then a short
                walk.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong class="text-ink">Metro:</strong>
                L9 Sud from the airport.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong class="text-ink">Bus:</strong>
                line 46 to Magòria-La Campana, then about a 10-minute walk.
              </li>
            </ul>
          </li>
          <li>
            Street numbers on our street go odd on one side and even on the other: look for our
            number on the odd side.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </ScrollReveal>

      <ScrollReveal client:load delay={0.2}>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink mb-4">Arriving</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-ink-muted mb-10 md:mb-12">
          <li>
            There's no self check-in: someone needs to open the door. Send your arrival time a day
            before so we can make sure someone's home.
          </li>
          <li>Ring the "bajos" bell.</li>
        </ul>
      </ScrollReveal>

      <ScrollReveal client:load delay={0.25}>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink mb-4">During your stay</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-3 text-ink-muted mb-10 md:mb-12">
          <li>Bedding and towels are provided, so no need to bring your own.</li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-ink">Wifi:</strong>
            there are four networks, named by color: {wifiNetworks.join(", ")}. They all use the
            same password, which is written on the whiteboard in the kitchen. They run on different
            modems, so some work better on some floors. If one is slow where you are, try another.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-ink">Kitchen:</strong>
            clean up after you cook. There's a sharing fridge, the white one, where everything is
            for everyone, and a separate gray fridge for your personal food. Ask before taking
            anything that isn't yours. If you leave food for the house when you go, put it on the
            shelves.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-ink">Quiet hours:</strong>
            after 11pm on weekdays, please keep the terraces quiet: our neighbours sleep right
            above them.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-ink">Terrace keys:</strong>
            they hang on the hook by the entrance. Please put them back.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-ink">Cleaning:</strong>
            our cleaner comes on Mondays and Thursdays, 9 to 12.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-ink">Enjoy:</strong>
            there's a sauna, board games, a terrace and a coworking space.
          </li>
          <li>The house is shared: leave it better than you found it.</li>
        </ul>
      </ScrollReveal>

      <ScrollReveal client:load delay={0.3}>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink mb-4">When you leave</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-ink-muted mb-10 md:mb-12">
          <li>
            Strip your bed and leave the used sheets and towels in the basket in the hallway,
            right in front of the bathroom door.
          </li>
          <li>If you're leaving early and don't want to wake anyone, just send a message.</li>
          <li>If your plans change, let us know so the bed can go to someone else.</li>
        </ul>
      </ScrollReveal>

      <ScrollReveal client:load delay={0.35}>
        <div class="bg-bone border border-athens rounded-xl p-6 mb-8">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink mb-2">Keep the house going</h2>
          <p class="text-ink-muted mb-4">
            The house runs on donations. If you'd like to contribute for your stay, give whatever
            feels right.
          </p>
          <a
            href="/donate"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-5 py-2.5 bg-grape text-white rounded-lg hover:bg-grape-dark transition-colors text-sm font-medium"
          >
            How to donate
          </a>
        </div>
      </ScrollReveal>

      <ScrollReveal client:load delay={0.4}>
        <p class="text-ink-muted text-sm">
          Questions during your stay? Write to us at
          <a
            href={SITE.houseTelegram}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="underline hover:text-grape-dark text-grape"
          >{SITE.houseHandle}</a>.
        </p>
      </ScrollReveal>

    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
